WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Composite bonding or porcelain veneers.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.500
Which one is right for you?

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.480
They can both transform your smile, but
they're very different treatments.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.040
Composite bonding is sculpted directly to
your teeth and is typically a more

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.980
conservative option. Porcelain veneers are
custom -made and bonded to the front

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.500
of your teeth.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.380
So which is better?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.720
It really depends on your teeth, your bite,
and the look you're trying to

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:23.840
achieve. We would love to see you for our
personal consultation and help you

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.720
decide which option is right for your smile.